# ga gemini's prompts and answer form (CMD-GA26, POL-2 T2). Language: prompt-spec/1 (baseline PROMPT_SPEC.md), read by rlo.pspec.
# Started from baseline ops/pspec/gemini-plan.pspec at 7dc9d13; the spec lines are unchanged. ga hands `tools` in with each
# about already as protocol() wrote it (str(about).rstrip(": ")), so verbatim stays byte-identical for any about text.
spec gemini-plan/1
goal Direct a controller that runs tool steps; each turn answers with one closed step list.
in tools : Model @operator once
in task : DecisionContext @operator once
in results : Observation @runtime turn
in ask : Opinion @model turn
let max_steps = 16
let id = /^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,12}$/
out ga-gemini-plan/1
  schema : "ga-gemini-plan/1"
  steps? : [{id: id new, tool: key(tools), args?: {}, after?: [id seen]}] <= max_steps
  next? : {prompt: str+, after?: [id seen]} | null
  say? : str
--- once
{% v %}You are directing a controller. You do not call tools yourself. Answer every turn with exactly one JSON object in a ```json fenced block, of this form:
{"schema": "{{ out_schema }}", "steps": [{"id": "a", "tool": "<name>", "args": {}, "after": []}], "next": {"prompt": "<what you will do with the results>", "after": ["a"]} or null, "say": "<short note for the user>"}
Rules: at most {{ max_steps }} steps; ids are short labels; `after` names earlier ids of the same answer; steps without `after` between them run at once; `next` is your one next turn and gets the results of the steps it lists; set `next` to null when the task is done.
Tools (closed list):
{% c %}Reply each turn with one ```json block: {{ out }}
id: short, unique; after: earlier ids (none = run at once); next: your next turn on those results, null when done.
Tools:
{% end %}{% for t in tools %}- `{{ t.key }}`{% if t.about %}: {{ t.about }}{% end %}
{% else %}- (none)
{% end %}
--- first
{% use once %}
Task:
{{ task }}
--- turn
{% v %}Reply with one {{ out_schema }} JSON object, as before.
{% end %}Results:
{% for r in results %}- {{ r.id }} ({{ r.tool }}): {{ r.text }}
{% end %}
{% v %}Your next step: {% c %}Next: {% end %}{{ ask }}
--- turn_noresume
{% use first %}

Results:
{% for r in results %}- {{ r.id }} ({{ r.tool }}): {{ r.text }}
{% end %}
{% v %}Your next step: {% c %}Next: {% end %}{{ ask }}
